         <div type="bio">
            <p>From a background in the military, although with extensive musical training, Blois first became involved with the Royal Opera House (Covent Garden) in 1919, and in 1928 became Managing Director of the Covent Garden Opera Syndicate. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
